<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-κρῐτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piercing, penetrating,</i> opp. <i>compressing</i>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκριτικός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				67e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1057b8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>separative,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ συγκριτική</span> (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				282b
			</span></i> sqq. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					164
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>able to distinguish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					388c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις ἕξις δ. σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Def.</u>
					411c
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				69
			</span></i>.</div>
